{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:ee3c0cc33668b1de","name":"Stokhli Spray Stick","source":{"id":"source:reference-ee3c0cc33668b1de","title":"Stokhli Spray Stick","revision":19581,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:13:45Z","sha256":"a152c112252d59da7911cf2bd0a2dddb66c3b262cb1f12bf5809ebe0ba03c100","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19581","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Stokhli%20Spray%20Stick&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-ee3c0cc33668b1de","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Stokhli Spray Stick is a hunting weapon designed to bring down a target without killing it. The Stokhli Spray Stick is one of the few long-range ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," weapons in the galaxy, and high demand for the weapon has driven its price up to match. The Stokhli Spray Stick fires a fine mist that coalesces into the form of a sticky webbing that wraps up its target as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Net"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Net","referenceId":"reference:660fb2c41d028988"}," does.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When the Stokhli Spray Stick's webbing strikes a target, it also discharges a stun bolt that can render some of the toughest targets unconscious. Any target struck by a Stokhli Spray Stick takes 3d8 points of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," damage; additionally, the Stokhli Spray Stick's webbing functions as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Net"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Net","referenceId":"reference:660fb2c41d028988"},", allowing the attacker to initiate a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grab"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grab","referenceId":"reference:7d935f258918d1a5"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grapple"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grapple","referenceId":"reference:4c93c2c050c768ed"}," on the target at range.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Stokhli Spray Stick requires canisters of spraymist to operate. After 80 shots, the canister must be replaced, and each canister costs 100 credits.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rifles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rifles","referenceId":"reference:a6ebe3ecc8b0b281"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Medium\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 14,000\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," -\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," Setting:"]}," YES (Only, 3d8)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Rate of Fire:"]}," Single-Shot\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 4 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Energy\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Restricted"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Restricted"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Inaccurate:"]}," This weapon cannot fire at targets at Long ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
